:"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1322445011":{"text":"Get lost! I've got drinking to do... haha, drinking!","source_cn":"走开，走开！别耽误我喝酒……哈哈，喝酒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B75AC93E6E8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322445012:1":{"text":"Tch, so annoying! Fine, fine! I got it. Now move along! I've got... a drink waiting!","source_cn":"嘁，真是麻烦！行了行了，我、我知道了。让让，我……要去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81CC38A6603F092B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322445016:1":{"text":"I'll tell her not to leave the house... hic! Will that be enough for you?","source_cn":"让她不要……近期不要出门，嗝！这就行了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFAEDAB0B4BA32EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1322445017:1":{"text":"Now move along... Do whatever you need to do! Just don't bother me again...","source_cn":"你们，该干什么就……干什么去吧！别来烦老子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E84420C04553045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Just make sure you tell her.","source_cn":"请务必转达","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5631C929FDF7DD74","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Just make sure you tell her.","female":"Just make sure you tell her.","variant_male_record_index":"70156","variant_female_record_index":"70157","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322445013:1":{"text":"What... what do you want from me?","source_cn":"你……你们要怎样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA312D657FBAC63B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322445014:1":{"text":"This is about Irina's safety. If you won't do it, we'll have to use force or resort to magic.","source_cn":"事关伊琳娜的人身安全，如果你做不到，我们就只能动用物理...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D617304A6C32145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322445015:1":{"text":"Ugh... fine, fine. I'll tell her... just leave me alone.","source_cn":"呃……算、算你厉害……行了，我……知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24A6F4AC1D7905B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"You leave us no choice...","source_cn":"你要是不听，就别怪我们……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x674FAD49ED9E0B06","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You leave us no choice...","female":"You leave us no choice...","variant_male_record_index":"70158","variant_female_record_index":"70159","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Please, take us to Irina.","source_cn":"请带我们见伊